title: "Evaluating AI's Role in Public Technology Literacy in Ghana"
abstract: "A mixed-methods research protocol and conceptual framework for evaluating whether AI-supported digital-literacy training improves public technology literacy in Ghana. No participant results are reported in this preprint."
